				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				751,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Output): Initialize browserViewGroup channels in TauriMainProcessService stub\n\nExpand the `browserViewGroup` entry in the `StubChannels` record within `Source/Service/Tauri/Main/Process/Service.ts` to define the full set of expected communication channels. This includes `updateKeybindings`, `updateTheme`, `updateConfiguration`, `getBrowserViews`, `openDevTools`, and `closeDevTools`.\n\nAligns the compiled Output artifact with the requirements of the upcoming Tauri UI implementations in Sky and Wind, ensuring that the IPC transform pipeline and runtime resolution logic have valid stub entries for all browser group operations before the native backend is fully wired.",
			"SHA": "6f571907334d9b133170adabb24cb92a838b19b3"
