			],
			"Message": "fix(Output): Hoist EditorResolverService imports above IEditorGroupsService\n\nRe-order the import statements in the compiled `Configuration/Service/CEL/Expose/Accessor.js` artifact. Move `IEditorResolverService` and `RegisteredEditorPriority` from a bottom import block to a position immediately following `IEditorGroupsService`.\n\nThis change aligns the compiled output with the `Source/` TypeScript definition and restores the consistent helpers-first, alphabetical import ordering required by the transform pipeline's pattern matching rules. It resolves a structural drift that could affect regex-based injection and patching scripts during the build process.\n\nNo runtime behavior is altered.",
			"SHA": "e9da8f45fc84511fb474d7f4ffaea07612ca8a1f"
		},
