			"Message": "feat(Output): Expose EditorResolverService and RegisteredEditorPriority\n\nAdd IEditorResolverService and RegisteredEditorPriority to the CEL ExposeAccessor in both Source and compiled Configuration artifacts. The TypeScript source in Source/Service/CEL/Expose/Accessor.ts is updated to import these new symbols from editorResolverService.js, and the ExposeAccessor function is extended to resolve IEditorResolverService and export the RegisteredEditorPriority constant.\n\nThis change ensures the extension host (Cocoon) has access to the editor resolver registry and priority constants via the exposed accessor interface, enabling proper handling of custom editor contributions and resolution logic.",
